        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũkaneenwa mũthenya ũsu, Sisya, ũũ nĩwe Ngai waitũ, nĩtwamweteelile, nake akatũtangĩĩa: ũũ nĩwe Yeova; nĩtwamweteelile, tũkeethĩwa na mũyo na kũtana ũtangĩĩonĩ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
