              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akatambũũkya moko make katĩ wayo, otondũ mũthambĩĩ ũtambũũkasya moko make athambĩe; ĩndĩ Yeova akatheesya ngathĩĩo yayo vamwe na ũĩ wa moko mayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngome ndũlu ya maũvai maku nũmĩtheeetye, nũmĩvalũkĩtye, na nũmĩkĩtye nthĩ, o kũvika kĩtoonĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.25.12"
            ]
